Package: writing-environment-boot-theme
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Writing Environment contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/moonknight82/writing-environment
Priority: optional
Section: utils
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-themes
Description: Quiet boot theme for the Writing Environment appliance
 Installs and activates the Writing Environment Plymouth splash. Raspberry Pi
 boot command-line customization is applied by the appliance image or one-time
 migration installer and is not overwritten during ordinary package upgrades.
